    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "A massive severing of professional ties will leave the severed workforce reeling. The company leader communicated a workforce reduction, eliminating 3,000 roles. To cushion the blow, a severance package as a parting gesture was offered, compensating for lost connection with 16 weeks of base pay plus two per year of tenure. This painful reinvention, a cold calculus disguised as necessary change, aims to accelerate product development acceleration in strategic hubs.",
